  featureProp="value"
/>
```

## Accessibility

Use `accessibilityLabel` to provide context for screen readers.

```jsx
<[ComponentName]
  accessibilityLabel="Descriptive label for screen readers"
  requiredProp="value"
/>
```

## Composed Examples

### [Real-World Use Case Name]

[Brief description of what this example demonstrates]

```jsx
